abraflexi-mailer (1.4.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Never send a document without its PDF: download is verified (HTTP 200,
    %PDF signature); missing PDF or attachment leaves it "to send" with error
  * Never send or mark as sent a document without a recipient address
  * Downloads go to a private per-message temporary directory (0700),
    always cleaned up, also in DRY_RUN and on errors
  * SEND_LOCKED works (any true value); invoices are locked again afterwards
  * Yes/no settings (ADD_LOGO, ADD_QRCODE, MUTE, DRY_RUN, APP_DEBUG,
    SEND_LOCKED) parsed properly – "false" no longer means true
  * Failed documents make the run exit with code 1
  * MultiFlexi app definitions reference https://multiflexi.eu/schema/application.json

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 11:30:00 +0100

abraflexi-mailer (1.4.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Version all MultiFlexi app definitions in a loop; drop leftover
    show_unsent reference (moved to abraflexi-zabbix) that produced an empty
    app definition breaking application import
  * postinst no longer patches PEAR Mail.php (Symfony Mailer is used)
  * Jenkinsfile.release: isolated workspace per distribution branch

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 03:40:00 +0100

abraflexi-mailer (1.4.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * SendUnsentWithAttachments: address documents by code instead of
    (possibly malformed) external id; a failing document no longer aborts
    the whole batch
  * DocumentMailer: attachment retrieval errors are logged, not fatal
  * Templater: do not read AbraFlexi nastaveni when COMPANY_NAME is set;
    support nested ${object.relation.property} (bspBan alias of bankovniUcet);
    drop /tmp/templatedata.json debug dump

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:55:00 +0100

abraflexi-mailer (1.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added confirmation mailers: PotvrzeniPrijetiUhrady, PotvrzeniPrijetiFaktury,
    PotvrzeniOdeslaniUhrady
  * New commands: abraflexi-potvrzeni-prijeti-uhrady,
    abraflexi-potvrzeni-prijeti-faktury, abraflexi-potvrzeni-odeslani-uhrady
  * Document ID passed via --docid or DOCID environment variable
  * MultiFlexi app definitions for all new commands
  * JSON report output conforming to MultiFlexi report schema
  * Configurable MAIL_SIGNATURE and SEND_INFO_TO environment variables
  * Modernize Debian packaging: debhelper-compat 13, remove composer-debian

